fixture a_fizzle_leaves_the_dash_alone
doc BUILD.md section 5, Dash: "180 u in 9 f" (task 6 review, M6): a spell pressed during a dash with no Flame fizzles on dash frame 6 and the dash runs on its full 180 u; it used to end the dash there.
room test/flat
frames 20
input
  0 R dash
  1 R
  2 R spell
  3..19 R
end
expect
  # Spawned at 200 u: the 180 u dash ends on dash frame 9 (frame 8) at 380 u.
  at 5 event.fizzle=1 dash_frame=6 state=dash
  at 8 state=dash dash_frame=9 x=380u
end
